hen~~f(x)~=~GF$\"\"%I)~g(x)~=~GF$F)" }}{PARA 11 "" 1 "" {XPPMATH 20 "6
(I(If~x~=~G6\"$\"#S!\"\"I/~then~~f(x)~=~GF$\"\"%I)~g(x)~=~GF$F)" }}
{PARA 11 "" 1 "" {XPPMATH 20 "6(I(If~x~=~G6\"$\"#X!\"\"I/~then~~f(x)~=
