{XPPMATH 20 "6(I(If~x~=~G6\"$\"#]!\"\"I/~then~~f(x)~=~GF$I)infinityG%*
protectedGI)~g(x)~=~GF$F)" }}}{EXCHG {PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 440 154 "Le
