ting Fact:" }{TEXT 403 293 " It is an open question whether or not the
re are any odd perfect numbers. So far no one has found one. In number
 theory you learn the structure of the even perfect numbers. So far on
ly a finite number of even perfect numbers have been found. But it is \+
suspected that there are infinitely many." }{TEXT 440 1 " " }}}{EXCHG 
{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 440 0 "" }}}{EXCHG {PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 440 0 "
